05f\u601d\u3044\u51fa"},{"ko":"\uc564\uc758 \uae08\uc9c0\ub41c \uae30\uc5b5\ub4e4"},{"es-la":"Los recuerdos prohibidos de Ann"},{"zh-hk":"\u5b89\u7684\u7981\u5fcc\u8a18\u61b6"},{"ja":"\u30a2\u30f3\u7981\u3058\u3089\u308c\u305f\u60f3\u3044\u51fa"},{"ja-ro":"Ann no Fuujirareta Omoide"},{"ja-ro":"Ann Kinjirareta Omoide"}],"description":{"de":"In einem kleinen Dort, das unter Hungersnot leidet, versucht ein junges, lebensfrohes M\u00e4dchen namens Ann alles, um die Herausforderungen, die ihr das Leben in den Weg stellt, zu meistern.","en":"In a small village that suffers from famine, a young girl full of life named Ann does her best to face the challenges life throws at her.\n\n---\nYou can find chapter previews and sketches on the author's [Twitter](https:\/\/twitter.com\/pokorotomas).","fr":"Dans un petit village ravag\u00e9 par la famine, une petite fille pleine de vie nomm\u00e9e Anne fait tout son possible relever les d\u00e9fis que la vie lui r\u00e9serve.","it":"In un piccolo villaggio colpito da una carestia, una ragazzina piena di energie di nome Ann affronta le sfide della vita come meglio pu\u00f2.","ja":"\u98e2\u9949\u306b\u82e6\u3057\u3080\u5c0f\u3055\u306a\u6751\u3067\u66ae\u3089\u3059\u5143\u6c17\u306a\u5c11\u5973\u3001\u30a2\u30f3\u304c\u81ea\u5206\u306b\u964d\u308a\u304b\u304b\u308b\u8a66\u7df4\u306b\u7acb\u3061\u5411\u304b\u3063\u3066\u3044\u304f\u3002","ko":"\uae30\uadfc\uc5d0 \uc2dc\ub2ec\ub9ac\ub294 \uc791\uc740 \ub9c8\uc744\uc5d0\uc11c \uc0b4\uc544\uac00\ub294 \ud65c\ubc1c\ud55c \uc18c\ub140 \uc564. \uc0b6\uc774 \ubd80\uc5ec\ud55c \uac16\uc740 \uace0\ub09c\uc5d0 \ub9de\uc11c \ucd5c\uc120\uc744 \ub2e4\ud558\ub294 \uc564\uc758 \uc778\uc0dd\uc740 \uacfc\uc5f0 \uc5b4\ub5bb\uac8c \uc804\uac1c\ub420\uae4c\uc694?","es-la":"En una aldea peque\u00f1a que sufre de hambruna, una joven chica llamada Ann hace su mejor esfuerzo para enfrentarse a los desaf\u00edos de la vida.","pt-br":"Em uma pequena vila que sofre com a escassez de comida, uma jovem cheia de vida chamada Ann d\u00e1 seu melhor para enfrentar os desafios de sua vida.","zh-hk":"\u5728\u4e00\u500b\u98fd\u53d7\u98e2\u8352\u7684\u5c0f\u6751\u838a\u88e1\uff0c\u5145\u6eff\u6d3b\u529b\u7684\u5c0f\u5973\u5b69\u5b89\u7aed\u76e1\u6240\u80fd\u9762\u5c0d\u751f\u6d3b\u5e36\u7d66\u5979\u7684\u6311\u6230\u3002"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"engtl":"https:\/\/namicomi.com\/t\/NTzfj5Nm?utm_source=md"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"en","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":null,"status":"ongoing","year":2023,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":[{"id":"2d1f5d56-a1e5-4d0d-a961-2193588b08ec","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Loli"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"33771934-028e-4cb3-8744-691e866a923e","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Historical"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"391b0423-d847-456f-aff0-8b0cfc03066b","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Action"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"5fff9cde-849c-4d78-aab0-0d52b2ee1d25","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Survival"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"87cc87cd-a395-47af-b27a-93258283bbc6","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Adventure"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"891cf039-b895-47f0-9229-bef4c96eccd4","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Self-Published"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"b9af3a63-f058-46de-a9a0-e0c13906197a","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Drama"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"cdc58593-87dd-415e-bbc0-2ec27bf404cc","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Fantasy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"e5301a23-ebd9-49dd-a0cb-2add944c7fe9","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Slice of Life"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"ee968100-4191-4968-93d3-f82d72be7e46","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Mystery"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2023-03-04T16:52:44+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-09-15T10:01:43+00:00","version":18,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["zh-hk","ko","es-la","en","it","ja","pt-br","de","fr"],"latestUploadedChapter":"b3038ced-5f26-47e5-8c03-f5035abdba16"},"relationships":[{"id":"caa8a4f1-676e-48f4-895e-037952fe225f","type":"author"},{"id":"caa8a4f1-676e-48f4-895e-037952fe225f","type":"artist"},{"id":"2c5bcc98-0a93-4a88-98a2-064d3044fddd","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":"2","fileName":"8304e702-38cc-49d8-a844-d75b552ee779.png","locale":"ja","createdAt":"2026-05-21T10:54:59+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-07-28T10:43:33+00:00","version":2}},{"id":"c9032c92-29ae-49ed-b885-39ddd7c9a536","type":"creator"}]},{"id":"463fa8b3-5ebf-43df-9ed0-773d82157601","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"en":"Tavern Quest"},"altTitles":[],"description":{"en":"With human blood coursing through her elven veins, Karma isn't highly regarded by the druids of the Grove. She struggles with maintaining a mana pool that's far more limited compared to her elven peers. However, she doesn't let this stop her as it is her life's goal to become a recognized druid. Unbeknownst to her, Karma will encounter a plethora of side quests along the way. Hopefully with the party she travels with, Karma will achieve that dream...that is, if her stubborn pride even allows them."},"isLocked":false,"links":{"engtl":"https:\/\/namicomi.com\/t\/49CvYxwM?utm_source=md"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"en","lastVolume":null,"lastChapter":null,"publicationDemographic":null,"status":